WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.268
-Good evening. Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.736
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.972
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:08.240
President Biden signed
an executive order yesterday

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.775
limiting
the government's ability

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:11.377
to use commercial spyware

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:13.413
that could be used
to hack citizens' phones

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:16.549
or, as he put it,
"We're going back to landlines."

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:18.485
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:20.887
The Manhattan grand jury
investigating allegations

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:22.055
that former President Trump

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:24.891
made illegal hush money payments
met yesterday

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:26.826
without voting
on a criminal indictment.

00:00:26.826 --> 00:00:29.595
Okay. In the words
of Stormy Daniels,

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:31.498
what is taking so long?

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:33.366
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.468
Look, until we see
that perp walk,

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.937
I'm just going to have
to keep showing this one.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:42.208 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.377
I do hope...

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.945
When he does have his perp walk,

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.714
I do hope they play
that brass band.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.649
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:51.517
Former President Trump
was interviewed last night

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:53.119
by Fox News host Sean Hannity.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:54.320
"Thanks for having me back,"

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.989
said Hannity and Trump
at the same time.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:58.123
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.123 --> 00:01:00.526
In a new interview with
Fox News host Sean Hannity,

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.095
former President Trump denied

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:04.597
having an affair with
adult film star Stormy Daniels,

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:06.832
which would actually be
a better explanation

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:07.933
for the hush money.

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:09.569
"Don't tell anybody.
We didn't do it."

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:12.371
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:14.774
In the same interview,
former President Trump claimed

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:16.542
that if
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:20.346
did not win the Republican
gubernatorial primary in 2018,

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.114
he would be working
in a pizza parlor.

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:26.386
Why do I feel like the only jobs
Trump knows are ones from porn?

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:27.987
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.955
"If I didn't endorse
Ron right now,

00:01:29.955 --> 00:01:32.892
he would be working as either
a plumber or a stepson."

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.628
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.197
Trump also said last night

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:39.298
that he has tapes
of the FBI raid on his

00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:40.433
Mar-A-Lago residence,

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:43.202
but he did have to record
over some stuff.

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:45.638
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:48.474
Oh, some...
[ Laughs ]

00:01:48.474 --> 00:01:51.143
Some sympathy for Eric tonight.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:54.647
Noted. Noted.

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:56.582
President Biden called
on Congress yesterday

00:01:56.582 --> 00:01:58.150
to pass an assault weapons ban,

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:00.285
which is sort of like
calling on McDonald's

00:02:00.285 --> 00:02:01.454
to make you a Whopper.

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:03.856
They could do it.
They just won't.

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:05.325
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:06.859
Former Vice President Mike Pence

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.595
is set tomorrow
to travel to Iowa,

00:02:08.595 --> 00:02:10.996
which I think is actually
the name of a color

00:02:10.996 --> 00:02:12.231
at Sherwin-Williams.

00:02:12.231 --> 00:02:15.835
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:19.605
North Dakota Governor --
[ Applause ]

00:02:19.605 --> 00:02:22.641
North Dakota...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:24.844
North Dakota Governor
Doug Burgum

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:27.012
is reportedly considering
running for president.

00:02:27.012 --> 00:02:29.248
And if you're wondering
what his chances are,

00:02:29.248 --> 00:02:31.551
that ain't him
and nobody noticed.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:34.053
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.053 --> 00:02:36.022
[ Applause ]

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.258
I'd vote for that guy though.

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:41.361
That guys does not like --

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:43.863
seem like he likes the path
this country is on.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:45.531
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:47.567
Authorities in California
recently arrested a man

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:50.936
who allegedly burglarized
several optometry offices.

00:02:50.936 --> 00:02:52.605
Witnesses described the subject

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:55.008
as a person between
four and eight feet tall

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:56.142
and very blurry.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:03:00.246
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:03.582
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.582 --> 00:03:06.552
They also -- They also thought
that last guy with Doug Burgum.

00:03:06.552 --> 00:03:08.221
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:10.423
And finally today
was National Hot Tub Day,

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.191
except in New York,
where the "jets" don't work.

00:03:12.191 --> 00:03:14.360
And that, you guys...
[ Audience shouting ]

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.661
Oh, come on.

00:03:15.661 --> 00:03:17.162
Come on.

00:03:17.162 --> 00:03:19.065
[ Laughs ]

